:null,"idx":null,"text":"第1次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第2次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第3次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判計時","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.unit","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"字","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:key_reading.benchmark_label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎ 我的表現","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:key_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"飛機失事後，哥倫比亞軍方派出上百名特種部隊隊員，","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這是一個真實故事，過去，我們已經學會用「問題—解決—結果」整理文章重點：\n1.發生了什麼問題？\n2.誰採取了什麼行動？\n3.行動最後帶來什麼結果？\n這一課再往前一步。〈奇蹟行動〉先寫搜救人員怎麼尋找孩子，寫到孩子獲救後，才回頭說明孩子如何在雨林中活下來。文章中有兩條分散在前後文的行動線，我們要把它們整理起來，才能找出全文重點。\n這一課要練習：\n❶抓核心問題→❷找出兩條行動線→❸看每條線解決哪一部分問題\n→❹整合結果","n":209,"ssz":"...1.......................................................................1....1...................1....1..........1.................................................1................................1........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這是一個真實故事，過去，我們已經學會用「問題—解決—結果」整理文章重點：","n":36,"ssz":"...1................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.發生了什麼問題？","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.誰採取了什麼行動？","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.行動最後帶來什麼結果？","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這一課再往前一步。〈奇蹟行動〉先寫搜救人員怎麼尋找孩子，寫到孩子獲救後，才回頭說明孩子如何在雨林中活下來。文章中有兩條分散在前後文的行動線，我們要把它們整理起來，才能找出全文重點。","n":90,"ssz":".1....1...................1....1..........1..............................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這一課要練習：","n":7,"ssz":".1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶抓核心問題→❷找出兩條行動線→❸看每條線解決哪一部分問題","n":29,"ssz":"..........................1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→❹整合結果","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、整理「問題—解決—結果」","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請你用過去學到的方法，整理本課的「問題—解決—結果」，並填入「解決」與「結果」所在的段落。","n":45,"ssz":"............................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"問題\n（第2～3段）","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].label#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"問題","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].label#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（第2～3段）","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.飛機墜毀後，這篇文章最重要的問題是什麼？（單選）","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"四名孩子如何搭乘小飛機前往北方城市？","n":18,"ssz":"...1.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"四名孩子受困雨林後，能否活下來並被找到？","n":20,"ssz":"...1................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"搜救人員如何在雨林中學會野外求生？","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑（Wingdings F0FE），文字流以符號字元存在","n":31,"ssz":"............